# Nordics API keys for ISZE Tender Monitor (Norway Doffin + Finland HILMA)
# Copy this file to: nordics_api_keys.env   (gitignored — never commit real keys)
# Then paste your Primary subscription keys below.
#
# Full steps: NORDICS_API_KEYS.md
# Verify:     python verify_nordics_keys.py

# Norway — Doffin Public API (search/download notices)
# Portal: https://dof-notices-prod-api.developer.azure-api.net/
# Subscribe to the Public API product (NOT the eSender Notices write API).
ISZE_DOFFIN_API_KEY=

# Finland — HILMA AVP-Read (fetch open notices)
# Portal: https://hns-hilma-prod-apim.developer.azure-api.net/
# Subscribe to product AVP-Read (free, immediate).
ISZE_HILMA_API_KEY=

# Belgium - BOSA e-Procurement (publicprocurement.be) Keycloak public client.
# Portal publishes this in its own front-end bundle: /env.config.js
# Read it from there once and paste below.
BE_BOSA_CLIENT_SECRET=
